{"data":{"body":"**P1:** Once shutdown enters `DRAINING`, this rejects durable operations created by an already-admitted child/map/parallel task. A queued branch that starts after the handler returns and calls `child.step(...)` therefore fails before that step is registered or checkpointed; the invocation can still return `SUCCEEDED` with the nested work omitted. Permit descendant registration from tasks admitted before draining and drain those newly registered descendants; add delayed nested-step tests for FLAT and NESTED map/parallel branches.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc72nJno","finding_digest":"a254bba40de085287344c01d91fa9bb6c5bd0ca82b497a3795a6602a1a7c7ba8","finding_id":"arf_v1_ujklxjan4ccsq42eyaozd6u3w3","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::registeroperation::admitted-descendant-operation-drain","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::registeroperation::admitted-descendant-operation-drain","line":231,"observation_digest":"280f799f354201a8c79863b6f0e48e2e34aa3f45801b00ae0a716022ddba4dd8","observation_id":"aro_v1_fahxthzviia2rr4ymo3pbzeofy","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ujklxjan4ccsq42eyaozd6u3w3","published_at":"2026-09-29T19:26:50Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6k4wzjhkhj6olykuzauuewt2jb","reviewed_base_sha":"def1f7ad235ea00f6053079b90da784cf061f895","reviewed_head_sha":"73b4b161a6958f2564b864019c93f47c4e7af316","reviewer":"codex","start_line":231,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":731},"record_id":"art_v1_67epxfkcmxvk2nqtwqbzpwcuag","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-29T19:26:50Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
